WEBVTT

00:41.666 --> 00:46.004
MY ROYAL NEMESIS

00:50.175 --> 00:53.386
Grand Prince Cheongheon is forbidden
from leaving his residence.

01:07.025 --> 01:07.901
Who is there?

01:09.569 --> 01:13.823
I have brought you some porridge.
Please eat it before it gets cold.

01:16.743 --> 01:20.246
Is that you? Why did you come?
Have you no fear? Someone could see you

01:20.330 --> 01:21.456
waiting there.

01:26.211 --> 01:29.589
I fear I am no longer able to
discern what is falsehood and what is

01:29.672 --> 01:33.635
genuine. Tell me, if you please, sir.

01:35.804 --> 01:37.430
What is the truth behind it all?

01:43.686 --> 01:47.148
You are quite naive, indeed. This is
why you are so easily fooled and

01:47.232 --> 01:48.108
used by men.

01:48.191 --> 01:49.025
What?

01:49.526 --> 01:51.236
You mustn't do anything for me.

01:54.572 --> 01:57.951
Focus on your survival, just as you
did when you were interrogated.

01:58.034 --> 01:59.410
Consider this…

02:01.746 --> 02:02.956
my final order to you.

02:14.050 --> 02:14.884
Kang Dan-sim…

02:19.764 --> 02:20.598
never…

02:26.396 --> 02:28.106
come to my private quarters again.

03:24.621 --> 03:25.455
Tell me…

03:28.208 --> 03:31.628
who are you really? Kang Clan, Dan-sim.

03:32.879 --> 03:34.088
Wait, what did you just…

03:35.798 --> 03:36.758
Who is she?

03:42.347 --> 03:45.767
What do you mean, "who am I?" Where did
that name come from? What is all this

03:45.850 --> 03:47.185
nonsense? And here of all places?

03:47.268 --> 03:51.147
I keep seeing a woman in my sleep.
A court lady with no family or friends.

03:51.231 --> 03:55.276
At first, I thought these were just vivid
dreams, but what's strange is that the

03:55.360 --> 03:59.697
Court Lady looks exactly like you.

04:16.005 --> 04:17.131
Maybe I've gone crazy.

04:20.760 --> 04:24.555
Well, at least you know how you sound.
You can't tell the difference between a

04:24.639 --> 04:27.058
-random dream and reality?
-Random?

04:27.141 --> 04:29.644
Yes, random. You must be out of your
mind to come here like this,

04:29.727 --> 04:33.564
talking nonsense about dreams. I'll head
inside now, go get dressed already.

04:46.452 --> 04:52.709
EPISODE 9
THAT'S FIRST LOVE FOR YOU

05:01.050 --> 05:03.261
-What should we do?
-Follow him.

05:12.770 --> 05:16.274
Tell me… who are you really? I keep
seeing a woman in my sleep. She's a

05:16.357 --> 05:21.029
court lady with no family or friends.

05:30.747 --> 05:31.831
In his dreams…

05:53.644 --> 05:56.189
Cha, this launch is a huge success.
If I had known you'd hit a home

05:56.272 --> 06:00.610
run on your first try, I would've
invested in your business from the start.

06:00.693 --> 06:03.279
I was thinking the same thing.
At this rate, you'll be breaking into

06:03.363 --> 06:06.115
the US market and taking over the
whole industry.

06:06.616 --> 06:09.911
No need to be scared of that. I won't
take it over entirely.

06:20.713 --> 06:24.467
Well, at least you know how you sound.
You can't tell a dream from reality?

06:32.934 --> 06:36.187
Yes, I thought so, too. It was
wonderful, a great idea, yeah. Oh,

06:36.270 --> 06:39.857
hello, so nice to see you here.

06:48.991 --> 06:52.662
Why do you keep following me all around
the room like a puppy who's lost? You

06:52.745 --> 06:55.957
should be out there getting
yourself noticed and snagging up

06:56.040 --> 06:58.584
every ad contract you can get your
hands on.

06:59.085 --> 07:01.796
-That's not really my field of work.
-"Field of work?"

07:01.879 --> 07:04.507
What's the point of being signed
to an agency if I have to go around

07:04.590 --> 07:08.511
selling my face like some street peddler?
You're not paid to just stand there.

07:11.389 --> 07:14.100
Why does she always have to have to
last word?

07:23.234 --> 07:24.068
Shin Seo-ri.

07:26.195 --> 07:27.530
I've been looking for you.

07:28.406 --> 07:29.824
Are you okay, Cha Se-gye?

07:30.450 --> 07:34.370
Don't worry about me. They're random,
right? And yet, they were so disturbing.

07:34.454 --> 07:38.082
Even that annoying Choi Mun-do was there.
Even in my dreams, he's an aspiring

07:38.166 --> 07:41.377
tyrant. Maybe that's why they say
dreams are an extension of your

07:41.461 --> 07:43.504
consciousness.

07:45.006 --> 07:48.843
Could it be they're not dreams? Maybe he
can truly see the past?

07:49.719 --> 07:50.553
Yep.

07:50.636 --> 07:52.054
There you are, Se-gye.

08:02.273 --> 08:05.067
Don't you remember our last conversation?
I said there's no communication

08:05.151 --> 08:07.195
until the engagement's official--

08:07.278 --> 08:08.988
No, wait, someone might hear you.

08:10.531 --> 08:13.701
You're right. That was thoughtless of me.
I'll be more careful.

08:15.578 --> 08:18.372
You really shouldn't do this, Se-gye,
especially not at an official event

08:18.456 --> 08:19.749
where I'm still--

08:19.832 --> 08:22.793
Yeah, his fiancée. I've heard that so
often, my ears are bleeding. Cha Se-gye,

08:22.877 --> 08:25.463
you have my permission. Take her
by the hand and go around the room.

08:25.546 --> 08:28.257
We should help the less fortunate.
That's not a big ask. Go on, let her

08:28.341 --> 08:30.343
have this one, okay?

08:30.426 --> 08:33.054
Who do you think you are to give him
permission?

08:33.137 --> 08:34.680
You really are an ungrateful pest.

08:34.764 --> 08:36.933
Oh, perfect! I see you're all here
already.

08:37.016 --> 08:39.352
Grandfather, I didn't expect to see you
here.

08:39.435 --> 08:42.355
Well, why wouldn't I come and see
my grandson's tiny business launch.

08:42.438 --> 08:46.025
Hello and welcome, Grandfather. If you'd
told me you were coming, I would've

08:46.108 --> 08:47.610
accompanied you myself.

08:48.444 --> 08:52.532
You're already supporting him as a wife,
Tae-hee. My dear Se-gye is truly blessed

08:52.615 --> 08:54.992
when it comes to women.

08:55.493 --> 08:56.577
Is that so?

08:59.497 --> 09:03.459
Grandfather, I would like you to meet the
brand ambassador for Dynaestie and the

09:03.543 --> 09:05.127
reason we're sold-out, Shin Seo-ri.

09:05.211 --> 09:06.504
Wait, Shin Seo-ri?

09:07.255 --> 09:10.883
I'm very pleased to meet you,
Grandfather.

09:13.344 --> 09:14.178
Uh…

09:15.137 --> 09:19.475
Enough. Stop that. Stop it! You can't
call him grandfather, yet.

09:19.559 --> 09:21.686
-Oh, I can't?
-Just call him, Mr. Cha.

09:22.812 --> 09:26.148
Oh, I also remember you insisting I
call you Mr. Cha when we first met.

09:26.232 --> 09:29.944
I guess being sensitive about titles
is something that runs in the family.

09:31.821 --> 09:34.782
You're very amusing. So, the model and
the CEO of the company are on informal

09:34.865 --> 09:35.700
terms?

09:37.118 --> 09:40.204
Not really, I mean… it's kind of
complicated.

09:40.788 --> 09:43.749
She's filming a period drama right now,
and she's quite immersed in her role.

09:43.833 --> 09:46.335
It's method acting, don't pay attention
to it. Look, Chairman Jung

09:46.419 --> 09:48.838
is over there. We should go.

09:48.921 --> 09:50.214
Chairman Jung. Yes, this way. Yes.

09:50.298 --> 09:51.632
Chairman Jung's here?

09:51.716 --> 09:54.510
Yes, we should go, Grandfather.

09:57.763 --> 09:58.639
You little wench.

10:01.475 --> 10:02.685
Oh, I was just lucky, I guess.

10:02.768 --> 10:05.896
Don't sell yourself short. It wasn't
luck, it was ability.

10:05.980 --> 10:07.565
Oh, you're too kind. Thank you.

10:07.648 --> 10:10.026
Thank you for coming, it was so
good to see you.

10:10.109 --> 10:13.112
-It was good to see you too.
-You should come by the office.

10:13.195 --> 10:14.030
Yes, of course.

10:14.113 --> 10:16.907
My grandson has just launched a new brand
called Dynaestie. We need to make it a

10:16.991 --> 10:18.117
-success.
-Yes, I see.

10:18.659 --> 10:21.162
I heard about it and had to come
congratulate him.

10:22.747 --> 10:26.876
He's very hardworking boy, you know, so
I'm pretty sure that this thing going to…

10:27.543 --> 10:30.254
Today's launch helps Cha restore
his image in the industry. The media's

10:30.338 --> 10:34.175
response is favorable, and opinion among
Chail employees is positive.

10:34.258 --> 10:37.219
I guess it's the result of the chairman's
halo effect, and all the hope people

10:37.303 --> 10:40.306
have for him as heir of the Chail Group.
What's the update on the nurse? Is she

10:40.389 --> 10:44.352
still in the hospital and unconscious?

10:44.435 --> 10:47.480
Yes, I've already bribed the staff
there, so they'll contact us if there's

10:47.563 --> 10:48.397
any change.

10:48.481 --> 10:50.650
No mistakes can be made with her
this time.

11:10.127 --> 11:12.046
You were a court lady in Cha's dream?

11:15.049 --> 11:18.719
If he's starting to see past events, then
they can't be prophetic dreams.

11:18.803 --> 11:21.097
Maybe it is reincarnation.

11:21.597 --> 11:24.725
I know you're a shaman, but your thinking
needs to keep up with the times. In

11:24.809 --> 11:28.396
this world of flying palanquins, do you
really think that makes any sense?

11:28.479 --> 11:32.650
Why wouldn't there be reincarnation
when we can transcend time and space?

11:36.237 --> 11:39.031
But, if it's really a form
of reincarnation, do you know

11:39.115 --> 11:40.282
who he could have been?

11:47.331 --> 11:50.710
You said this Choi Mun-do guy
is the king, then wouldn't Mr. Cha be

11:50.793 --> 11:52.837
someone who's close to the King?

11:54.630 --> 11:57.341
Your dreams are telling you a story?
Would you say you've been stressed

11:57.425 --> 11:58.259
lately?

11:58.342 --> 12:01.178
Obviously… I'm surrounded by landmines.
Never mind, just prescribe me some

12:01.262 --> 12:04.306
sleeping pills. Strong ones that won't
let me dream.

12:04.807 --> 12:07.810
Well, dreams can't really be suppressed
at will. You need to relax and let

12:07.893 --> 12:11.689
yourself go with the flow. Who knows?
They could be prophetic dreams.

12:11.772 --> 12:14.942
Prophetic? Are you even paying attention?
What kind of doctor are you? I'm not

12:15.025 --> 12:18.487
seeing the future, but the past.

12:18.571 --> 12:22.116
That doesn't really matter. They're
equally connected to the present.

12:22.199 --> 12:25.703
You know, you can't think of time as a
straight line. Things can exist

12:25.786 --> 12:26.662
simultaneously.

12:27.246 --> 12:28.080
Are you serious?

12:31.959 --> 12:36.046
Who'd have thought the chairman would be
there in person? I think it's a positive

12:36.130 --> 12:36.964
sign, yeah?

12:37.047 --> 12:40.718
A sign? Yeah, it's a sign that your
imagination is playing tricks on you.

12:41.302 --> 12:43.971
I mean, we've been desperately
waiting for him to ask you to return to

12:44.054 --> 12:46.640
headquarters, to work with him again, and
finally…

12:46.724 --> 12:50.144
I've been so desperately waiting,
I'm even having dreams about it.

12:50.227 --> 12:53.063
Of course, it'll be a slightly longer
commute, but hey! Sleep's overrated,

12:53.147 --> 12:53.981
right?

12:54.064 --> 12:56.192
Yeah, I haven't been sleeping well
at all.

12:57.193 --> 13:00.446
I guess this could be a symptom of sleep
deprivation. Mr. Son, you really

13:00.529 --> 13:02.615
do have a keen sense of observation.

13:02.698 --> 13:06.494
Yeah. Well, could I go on vacation before
we return to HQ?

13:06.994 --> 13:09.580
Oh, I'll tell you what, you can go
on vacation the same time I go

13:09.663 --> 13:11.999
-on vacation.
-Oh, what, really? When would that be?

13:12.082 --> 13:13.042
Just after I die.

13:22.927 --> 13:23.761
Oh, no, what's wrong?

13:23.844 --> 13:26.555
My teeth have been sensitive since
yesterday, and my gums are sore.

13:26.639 --> 13:29.558
You may not be going on vacation, but you
better go see a dentist. Teeth are

13:29.642 --> 13:32.478
the one thing you can lose quickly if
you wait too long.

13:33.395 --> 13:34.230
A dentist?

13:37.858 --> 13:41.278
Mr. Cha, how are you? These documents
need your approval, and here's

13:41.362 --> 13:42.571
the script.

13:43.239 --> 13:44.198
"Kingdom of Women?"

13:46.575 --> 13:48.285
Oh, the one Shin Seo-ri's in?

13:48.369 --> 13:51.664
Their marketing team asked about product
placement, but these days, TV dramas

13:51.747 --> 13:55.626
don't have much advertising impact, so
I turned them down. You can ignore it.

13:55.709 --> 13:56.544
"In bed?"

13:56.627 --> 13:58.754
PALACE, GWIIN'S QUARTERS
SHARING A BED ON A RAINY NIGHT

13:58.838 --> 13:59.672
Stay still.

13:59.755 --> 14:00.756
THE KING AND THE GWIIN SIT SIDE BY SIDE
IN THEIR UNDERGARMENTS

14:00.840 --> 14:02.800
-I am shy, Your Majesty.
-Oh, would you come here.

14:02.883 --> 14:05.511
Wait, Your Majesty. Why are you in such
haste, sire?

14:06.136 --> 14:08.931
Why are you being so shy? One would
think you are a newlywed bride on her

14:09.014 --> 14:11.183
wedding night. Now, come here.

14:11.267 --> 14:13.644
Oh, Your Majesty. Can you put out
the candle?

14:25.823 --> 14:29.201
I will not put out the candle light,
as I wish to see all this laid

14:29.285 --> 14:30.619
bare to my eyes.

14:31.370 --> 14:34.707
Your Majesty. Your Majesty!

14:37.251 --> 14:38.127
Idiots!

14:41.005 --> 14:42.381
-Watch out.
-I'm sorry, sir!

14:42.464 --> 14:44.049
I took a sip because I was
feeling sleepy.

14:44.133 --> 14:47.261
-Argh! Damn, seriously?
-I'm sorry. I'm sorry about the coffee.

14:47.344 --> 14:50.681
Mr. Son, contact the product placement
manager… right now.

14:51.181 --> 14:53.767
You're the Assistant Director,
help us out. You can't just cut an

14:53.851 --> 14:56.979
entire scene without notice! What are we
supposed to do now?

14:57.062 --> 14:59.523
Hey, look, we had a last minute
request from a placement partner.

14:59.607 --> 15:02.776
They offered so much money, even the
director couldn't say no.

15:02.860 --> 15:06.322
Well, why should we let it go just
because you guys decided it was alright?

15:06.405 --> 15:07.823
Here, just learn the new scene.

15:07.907 --> 15:10.826
You know, you should've done it right the
first time around.

15:10.910 --> 15:15.205
What's with this last minute scene
change? What has it been replaced with?

15:15.289 --> 15:16.999
A Royal Sericulture Ceremony.

15:17.082 --> 15:18.542
A… ceremony?

15:18.626 --> 15:20.085
So a ceremony's the problem?

15:24.757 --> 15:26.216
COURTYARD OF THE SEOHYANG PAVILION, DAY

15:26.300 --> 15:28.928
THE SOUND OF TRADITIONAL JOSEON MUSIC
FILLS THE YARD

15:29.011 --> 15:33.098
ROYAL SERICULTURE CEREMONY IN PROGRESS
CONCUBINES, COURT LADIES STAND IN TWO ROWS

15:33.182 --> 15:37.269
ROYAL SERICULTURE CEREMONY IN PROGRESS
CONCUBINES, COURT LADIES STAND IN TWO ROWS

15:52.660 --> 15:55.245
The Naemyeongbu is in utter chaos.
The Royal Sericulture Ceremony is

15:55.329 --> 15:58.165
the Queen's prerogative, so why is
she here?

15:58.248 --> 16:01.210
Her Majesty has suddenly taken ill with
indigestion. We have no choice, we

16:01.293 --> 16:02.670
cannot postpone it.

16:18.811 --> 16:20.980
Oh, my, look at that. It's a butterfly.

16:21.480 --> 16:24.400
I was wondering where this lovely scent
was coming from. It must be coming

16:24.483 --> 16:25.567
from Gwiin Jang.

16:25.651 --> 16:27.903
Her complexion is as clear as white jade.

16:27.987 --> 16:31.699
As they say, the one with the most
beautiful skin rules the palace.

16:38.914 --> 16:42.876
When the stormy sea grows calm, and the
winds have died, will you come forth to

16:42.960 --> 16:46.880
me today from over that yonder hill? As
the sunlight sparkles upon the ever-so

16:46.964 --> 16:50.009
JE

16:57.016 --> 16:57.850
Biojei.

16:59.393 --> 17:02.187
Cut! Oh, that was so good! That was
really great.

17:03.605 --> 17:06.442
Good job, everyone. Well done!

17:06.942 --> 17:09.486
Oh, my shoulders. My goodness.

17:09.570 --> 17:12.489
Have the writer and director both
lost their minds? How can they spring

17:12.573 --> 17:14.116
a script change on us?

17:14.199 --> 17:16.785
Yeah, I know honey, but the product
placement deal was for a massive

17:16.869 --> 17:19.329
amount of money. You know how
things work, these shows are always

17:19.413 --> 17:21.874
short on cash, so when they get a
chance to fill the hole, well,

17:21.957 --> 17:23.584
they take it.

17:24.460 --> 17:27.254
And why did they have to fill the
hole with my only solo scene? That's so

17:27.337 --> 17:28.213
unfair.

17:29.089 --> 17:31.925
Then, you should've agreed to do product
placement in the first place.

17:32.009 --> 17:34.928
What on earth are you talking about?
I can't do free advertising for a brand

17:35.012 --> 17:36.472
Shin Seo-ri represents!

17:36.555 --> 17:39.391
Why do you always get so worked up
every time Shin Seo-ri's name comes up?

17:39.475 --> 17:41.018
Do you have an inferiority complex?

17:41.101 --> 17:44.021
Why the hell would I have an inferiority
complex? Damn it!

17:53.197 --> 17:55.741
Cut! Okay, that was great!

17:55.824 --> 17:56.742
Alright, that's a wrap!

17:56.825 --> 17:57.993
Great job, Seo-ri!

17:58.869 --> 18:00.120
Everyone, go to wardrobe.

18:01.330 --> 18:02.915
They say she's an acting prodigy.

18:02.998 --> 18:06.460
Her diction's incredible. What a
great gift for the director.

18:07.252 --> 18:08.170
She's really good.

18:09.046 --> 18:10.964
Thanks again. Good work.

18:26.480 --> 18:28.065
She's the one with the complex.

18:29.650 --> 18:32.319
Even if it's school break, you
need to eat well. You have to eat a lot

18:32.402 --> 18:34.279
because you're small for your age, okay?

18:34.363 --> 18:38.117
Dad, I was thinking about it, can't I
just fly over there?

18:41.662 --> 18:46.458
I've been telling my nanny everyday…
that I really wanna go see you.

18:46.542 --> 18:49.461
Seo-jun, you know I'm a very busy person.
Even if you come to Korea, I won't

18:49.545 --> 18:53.715
have time to hang out with you. Hey,
Seo-jun…

19:25.581 --> 19:29.084
Book me a flight to the US for this
weekend. Just book the… the Friday

19:29.168 --> 19:30.085
red-eye.

19:43.223 --> 19:44.057
Okay…

19:50.522 --> 19:53.025
Mr. Choi, the people at the
hospital called.

20:01.992 --> 20:05.078
How could they just lose a patient? An
unconscious woman.

20:05.162 --> 20:07.915
They said she was still unconcious
when they did their last rounds.

20:07.998 --> 20:10.459
Security cameras? Do we have any idea
where she went?

20:10.542 --> 20:13.378
It seems she took a taxi in front of
the main entrance. We're looking into

20:13.462 --> 20:14.796
where she could have gone.

20:15.964 --> 20:19.259
You need to find her as soon as possible.
She better not start talking to

20:19.343 --> 20:22.137
anyone about what happened…
and especially not the chairman or

20:22.221 --> 20:23.055
Se-gye.

20:24.723 --> 20:28.769
I can't believe how witty you are.
That poem ad-lib was really impressive.

20:30.020 --> 20:33.607
I thought best to do it right. They even
planned to have a white butterfly

20:33.690 --> 20:35.317
land on my shoulder.

20:38.612 --> 20:40.781
-You want one?
-Hard candy?

20:44.660 --> 20:46.411
A sweet reward after hard work.

20:49.831 --> 20:51.291
Seo-ri. Seo-ri!

20:52.501 --> 20:53.335
Director.

20:53.418 --> 20:56.213
That was really phenomenal! Especially
since actors these days hate to do

20:56.296 --> 20:57.756
the product placement.

20:57.839 --> 21:00.592
Well, what can I do? Since everyone
hates it, it falls to a supporting

21:00.676 --> 21:01.677
actress.

21:01.760 --> 21:05.639
Oh, no, no! You don't understand,
It's the product placement CEO who asked

21:05.722 --> 21:08.183
that it be you, specifically, who does
the ad.

21:09.393 --> 21:10.352
They wanted me to do it?

21:10.435 --> 21:14.231
Yes, that's what I'm saying. You,
personally. Way to go!

21:32.708 --> 21:34.960
I guess this is what I have to do to
see her.

21:36.378 --> 21:38.714
I hope they got rid of that bed-sharing
scene.

21:46.555 --> 21:48.849
Hey! You there! Stop where you are.

21:52.602 --> 21:53.437
Who are you?

21:53.520 --> 21:57.065
Me? I'm someone who's poured a lot of
money into this TV drama. I need to

21:57.149 --> 22:00.068
know, has Shin Seo-ri's bed sharing
scene been cut?

22:03.613 --> 22:06.742
Hey, look, you can't just barge onto
this set, okay? What are you, some

22:06.825 --> 22:08.118
kind of fan? Hey, manager!

22:08.201 --> 22:10.579
There won't be any bed-sharing
scenes going forward either. No

22:10.662 --> 22:13.081
unnecessary physical contact with her.

22:13.165 --> 22:14.124
Who do you think you are?

22:14.207 --> 22:15.042
Me?

22:19.296 --> 22:20.630
I'm Shin Seo-ri's stalker.

22:24.384 --> 22:25.218
Okay…

22:45.238 --> 22:48.325
You can't keep barging on set like
this without notifying me. We have to

22:48.408 --> 22:49.659
be discreet, right?

22:49.743 --> 22:52.704
I don't want to. I've been too concerned
about everything that I've stressed

22:52.788 --> 22:55.457
myself out. That's why I'm having
these weird dreams. So I'm gonna cut

22:55.540 --> 22:57.167
myself some slack and do what I want to.

22:57.250 --> 22:58.835
You already do what you want!

22:59.378 --> 23:01.046
Someone changed the script today.

23:01.129 --> 23:03.715
Yeah… that little script change
was thanks to me.

23:03.799 --> 23:04.758
Little?

23:04.841 --> 23:08.053
Well, it was because I heard some
nasty rumors about the male lead.

23:08.136 --> 23:11.723
Apparently, he's known for messing up his
kissing scenes and contacting

23:11.807 --> 23:15.727
the actresses. I heard he's a real jerk,
so, of course, I wanted to protect my

23:15.811 --> 23:19.898
investment. And why do I have to justify
myself? You know, you should be thanking

23:19.981 --> 23:20.816
me!

23:20.899 --> 23:24.611
You're right, thank you, sir. Thanks to
you, I completely stole the scene.

23:30.242 --> 23:31.159
Is that all I get?

23:35.497 --> 23:36.623
I can give you this.

23:39.000 --> 23:41.837
-I really don't like hard candy, you know.
-Too bad.

23:41.920 --> 23:42.796
Wait!

23:46.258 --> 23:47.467
How incredibly sweet.

23:48.885 --> 23:50.178
Gross. Your saliva.

23:59.521 --> 24:02.732
I want you to create a position for
Se-gye at the firm. We can't

24:02.816 --> 24:05.444
keep him shut out of the family business
forever.

24:06.278 --> 24:08.947
We should ask him how he feels about
it first. His startup isn't small

24:09.030 --> 24:10.282
enough to be run on its own.

24:10.365 --> 24:13.076
He can always leave it in the hands of a
professional CEO. Everything's

24:13.160 --> 24:15.537
possible if you really want it.

24:23.044 --> 24:25.172
Is there somewhere you want to go
with me?

24:25.672 --> 24:26.631
Somewhere with you?

24:27.966 --> 24:31.219
We haven't even been on a proper
date yet. Let's see… Where could

24:31.303 --> 24:34.514
we go at this time of day?

24:38.435 --> 24:41.813
Why do you always have to be such
a scoundrel looking at me like that?

24:41.897 --> 24:43.356
I think I just hurt my tooth.

24:44.858 --> 24:47.777
You should have sucked on that candy.
If you crunch it, of course you're gonna

24:47.861 --> 24:50.822
-end up hurting your teeth.
-Why would I do that, it takes too long.

24:50.906 --> 24:53.867
Nice things should always be savored.
Rich people don't know how to appreciate

24:53.950 --> 24:54.784
things.

24:55.577 --> 24:56.411
That's not true.

24:58.955 --> 25:02.501
I know how to savor you. I'm gonna
make this feeling last.

25:07.756 --> 25:08.924
You're bleeding! Quick!

25:09.466 --> 25:10.425
What? I'm bleeding?

25:15.305 --> 25:16.139
Oh…

25:22.437 --> 25:24.689
You really did a number on that wisdom
tooth.

25:27.400 --> 25:30.862
Don't worry, your gums are pink so
you weren't poisoned. The bleeding

25:32.197 --> 25:34.866
TOOTH OF WISDOM: THE JOSEON-ERA NAME
FOR WISDOM TOOTH

25:35.951 --> 25:37.661
of musk for the pain.

25:37.744 --> 25:38.787
Burn chicken droppings?

25:38.870 --> 25:41.915
Come on, start burning it already! This
patient is hurting, you should be giving

25:41.998 --> 25:44.209
-him acupuncture!
-It's really not that bad, you know…

25:44.292 --> 25:46.795
Just stop! You're a patient, you
don't know. Stay!

25:46.878 --> 25:47.754
Take it easy, Shin Seo-ri.

25:47.837 --> 25:50.340
It's an impacted wisdom tooth. You need
surgery right away.

25:50.423 --> 25:51.258
What's impacted?

25:51.341 --> 25:54.844
What? Just pull it out! Why would I need
surgery for a wisdom tooth?

25:54.928 --> 25:58.056
Well, it really depends on the case.
You can see the wisdom tooth on the left

25:58.139 --> 26:00.934
needs to be extracted surgically.
So, would you like to go ahead with the

26:01.017 --> 26:02.519
surgery now?

26:03.228 --> 26:06.231
Yes! Please go do whatever you need to
do. Here!

26:06.314 --> 26:07.399
Okay, I'll get ready.

26:07.482 --> 26:08.692
This is why I hate dentists.

26:08.775 --> 26:09.943
Say Ah! Ah!

26:11.278 --> 26:12.112
-Okay.
-Let's see…

26:12.195 --> 26:13.780
OPERATING UNIT

26:15.198 --> 26:17.993
I can't believe I need general anesthesia
for a wisdom tooth?

26:18.076 --> 26:20.495
It was a good idea to come to a
big hospital. Thanks to me,

26:20.579 --> 26:22.539
your precious life is being spared once
more.

26:22.622 --> 26:25.750
Come on, it's just my teeth, it's not
like I was gonna die.

26:25.834 --> 26:28.587
You need to make sure this is
taken care of, once and for all.

26:28.670 --> 26:30.255
And always suck on hard candy.

26:31.131 --> 26:31.965
Are you leaving?

26:32.048 --> 26:34.175
Well, of course I'm leaving, it's already
late!

26:34.259 --> 26:38.013
Exactly, it's too late to leave.
Stay here.

26:41.182 --> 26:43.351
I'll be in pain when I'm out of surgery.

26:43.435 --> 26:45.395
You said it wasn't like you were going
to die.

26:45.478 --> 26:48.189
Even so, I'm still having surgery
because I'm hurt. It wouldn't be very

26:48.273 --> 26:50.775
nice to abandon someone you've just
started seeing.

26:50.859 --> 26:53.945
That's a pretty indirect way
of telling me to look after you.

26:54.613 --> 26:56.698
It's time for you to go into surgery now.

27:03.288 --> 27:04.122
I trust you!

27:05.248 --> 27:06.166
Don't leave, okay?

27:07.626 --> 27:08.460
Promise me.

27:17.427 --> 27:18.845
We're putting you under now.

27:36.112 --> 27:36.946
By heaven,

27:38.031 --> 27:40.533
now that I have met you and come to
know you,

27:41.034 --> 27:42.619
we shall never be torn asunder.

27:44.162 --> 27:47.916
When the mountain peaks wear down and
the rivers have run dry, when thunder

27:47.999 --> 27:50.293
rumbles in winter, and snow falls
in summer,

27:51.461 --> 27:53.171
when the sky and earth become one,

27:54.839 --> 27:56.675
only then shall we finally part.

28:10.605 --> 28:15.276
I couldn't possibly… give this
painting to her.

28:32.377 --> 28:33.878
Mr. Cha, can you hear me?

28:36.756 --> 28:37.590
Where is she?

28:37.674 --> 28:41.302
Don't worry, your gums might feel
a bit sore from the surgery. You should

28:41.386 --> 28:44.723
ice the area for the next 48 hours.
If everything looks good tomorrow

28:44.806 --> 28:47.183
morning, you can go home after you're
discharged.

28:47.267 --> 28:50.478
Excuse me, do you know if she's left?

28:50.979 --> 28:51.813
Who do you mean?

28:59.821 --> 29:03.616
I guess she did. Well, that was
heartless of her.

29:34.564 --> 29:37.692
Is that not lucky wood? You know,
wood from a lightning-struck

29:37.776 --> 29:41.446
jujubee tree? When I was little, my
father was a potions peddler. Sometimes,

29:41.529 --> 29:45.575
women would ask him to bring some to
offer it to the gods to cure their sons.

29:45.658 --> 29:49.412
Who are you praying for? Your father?
Your brother? Oh, you said you had no

29:49.496 --> 29:50.371
family.

30:16.439 --> 30:20.193
What's going on? I thought you'd left.

30:21.361 --> 30:24.280
I thought you told me not to. I went to
get some ice.

30:31.079 --> 30:33.957
Hey! You must be freezing. Why did you
carry this in your hands? You didn't

30:34.040 --> 30:36.042
have to do that.

30:37.335 --> 30:41.965
What else would I have used? My head?
You were hurting so I did something.

30:45.009 --> 30:47.512
I cannot do much for you, except
things like this.

30:54.477 --> 30:55.645
Your hands are so cold…

30:58.815 --> 31:03.111
Enough, stop it! You're sick, you should
just lie still. That would help me a lot.

31:05.947 --> 31:09.284
You look like one of those pufferfish
with your cheek all swollen.

31:11.244 --> 31:14.831
You should leave now. I can tell you're
enjoying this. Jeez… Ever since

31:14.914 --> 31:21.838
we started going out, I feel like
I'm getting more and more pathetic.

31:35.810 --> 31:39.647
You know those random dreams. Do you
still have them sometimes?

31:41.816 --> 31:46.362
Why? You said they were all nonsense,
but they actually got to you, huh?

31:47.363 --> 31:50.825
If you can't tell us apart, then she
must really look like me. I just

31:50.909 --> 31:52.911
wonder what kind of dreams they are?

31:56.623 --> 32:02.086
I would say they're kind of sad. I don't
think they're gonna end well.

32:04.047 --> 32:04.881
They're sad?

32:04.964 --> 32:08.718
I guess I'm falsly accused. I get
locked up, and stuff like that. Seems to

32:08.801 --> 32:12.805
be heading towards a sad ending. I think
I'll be exiled soon.

32:13.473 --> 32:14.682
What do you mean exiled?

32:17.936 --> 32:20.355
And who do you seem to be in those
dreams?

32:20.438 --> 32:21.272
Me?

32:23.358 --> 32:27.320
Everyone calls me "Your Royal Highness."
"His Royal Highness the Grand Prince."

32:27.403 --> 32:32.200
Even in my dreams, I'm some kind of
Prince or something…

32:35.578 --> 32:38.748
I guess I was right. Bad feelings
are never wrong.

32:40.124 --> 32:42.752
This Grand Prince, he has strong
feelings for a court lady named Kang

32:42.835 --> 32:43.836
Dan-sim.

32:44.837 --> 32:45.797
He must resent me.

32:46.297 --> 32:47.298
He truly loves…

32:51.469 --> 32:54.263
He truly yearns… for her.

32:57.684 --> 33:01.396
By heaven, now that I have met you
and come to know you, we shall never be

33:01.479 --> 33:05.191
torn asunder. When the mountains wear
down and the rivers have run dry, when

33:05.274 --> 33:08.695
thunder rumbles in winter and
snow falls in summer, when the sky and

33:08.778 --> 33:15.118
earth become one, only then shall we
finally part.

33:16.077 --> 33:19.664
This is so beautiful. You can tell
he's in love with her… like the fool

33:19.747 --> 33:20.581
he is.

33:25.378 --> 33:28.715
JOINING HANDS WITH MOCHANG,
IS THE SUCCESSION BATTLE TAKING SHAPE?

33:28.798 --> 33:32.176
Why in the world would you wear
that dress? It makes you look short. I

33:32.260 --> 33:36.180
told you, you need to raise the waistline
to make you look taller. How can someone

33:36.264 --> 33:39.183
who runs her own company have
such terrible fashion taste?

33:40.309 --> 33:43.146
Wow, it's been a while, Mom. I see you
still have your beautiful looks and

33:43.229 --> 33:44.105
wicked tongue.

33:44.188 --> 33:47.275
That's no way to greet your mother after
such a long time. You come back to Korea

33:47.358 --> 33:50.236
and instead of coming home, you decide to
chase after a man you're not even

33:50.319 --> 33:51.279
married to.

33:51.362 --> 33:54.699
I guess I like being with him more than
with you. When I'm over there, no one is

33:54.782 --> 33:55.700
constantly nagging me.

33:55.783 --> 33:56.743
Really?

33:57.243 --> 34:00.788
Either way, I'm glad you're here,
I need to accelerate things. I want you

34:00.872 --> 34:04.917
to invite us over, Se-gye and I.

34:13.217 --> 34:17.513
MOCHANG HEIR'S ATTENDANCE AT CHA SE-GYE'S
BRAND LAUNCH DRAWS STOCK MARKET ATTENTION

34:17.597 --> 34:20.725
They're really shouting it from the
rooftops, aren't they?

34:24.395 --> 34:25.646
MS. SHIN, LET'S MEET SOON

34:28.608 --> 34:30.943
Ms. Shin, let's meet soon.

34:31.903 --> 34:32.737
Could it be him?

34:34.739 --> 34:36.365
GRANDMA

34:38.117 --> 34:40.828
Hey, why did you put me here? It
has to be costing a fortune. Just make

34:40.912 --> 34:42.205
them take me back.

34:42.288 --> 34:44.916
Why would you want to be in an
overcrowded room?

34:44.999 --> 34:46.209
So you can fight all day?

34:46.292 --> 34:49.045
I don't fight! What do you mean?
No, those old ladies are just bored and

34:49.128 --> 34:51.839
running their mouths off, that's all.

34:51.923 --> 34:55.218
You said you didn't wanna stay
there long. You'll recover faster in

34:55.301 --> 34:58.888
that room. It's a nice, bright
room, right? With clean air?

35:01.933 --> 35:02.892
You're not wrong…

35:02.975 --> 35:06.729
And what do you mean, I can't afford it?
Haven't you seen me on TV? I have

35:06.813 --> 35:10.775
lots of money, so don't worry. Focus on
eating well and getting better quickly,

35:10.858 --> 35:11.692
okay?

35:11.776 --> 35:15.613
To think, I'm living a life of luxury at
my age, and all thanks to my little

35:15.696 --> 35:16.781
angel.

35:18.783 --> 35:22.161
But, you know, Seo-ri, I kind of
prefer having those ladies around.

35:22.245 --> 35:25.748
I don't like being here, like this, by
myself. When people are around,

35:25.832 --> 35:29.669
I feel more alive, you know? No matter
how incredible someone is, they can't

35:29.752 --> 35:33.589
live by themselves. What kind of a person
goes in alone? Then you're not really

35:33.673 --> 35:39.720
living, are you? You're withering
away until the end.

35:51.983 --> 35:54.944
So there, that young lady with whom I
shared a table with the other day, does

35:55.027 --> 35:56.028
she come here often?

35:56.112 --> 35:59.282
She does, she comes here two or
three times a week. Why do you

35:59.365 --> 36:00.408
wanna know?

36:00.908 --> 36:03.786
Oh, for no reason. I was just impressed
with her. It's unusual for a young

36:03.870 --> 36:07.290
person to come here and eat alone.

36:07.373 --> 36:11.252
Well, maybe she doesn't have any friends,
many youngsters come here alone.

36:11.335 --> 36:13.754
Maybe she doesn't… have friends.

36:17.341 --> 36:20.428
Tell me, what's her character like?
What do you think of her?

36:21.304 --> 36:23.723
Why do you care what her character
is like? Are you planning on

36:23.806 --> 36:24.640
marrying her?

36:24.724 --> 36:27.935
What are you talking about, old hag? Have
you gone insane? Really!

36:28.019 --> 36:30.396
She's not very nice, she's never
polite and when she talks to

36:30.479 --> 36:33.149
other clients, she talks as if they
were beneath her.

36:37.737 --> 36:38.571
I see.

36:43.826 --> 36:47.038
No matter how incredible someone is,
they can't live by themselves.

36:47.121 --> 36:50.291
Kang Dan-sim, never come to my private
quarters again.

36:50.791 --> 36:54.670
What kind of a person goes in alone?
Then you're not really living, are you?

36:54.754 --> 36:56.923
You're withering away until the end.

36:57.006 --> 37:01.010
Everyone calls me "Your Royal Highness."
"His Royal Highness the Grand Prince."

37:02.553 --> 37:03.429
You're back late.

37:08.184 --> 37:09.018
Have you eaten?

37:12.563 --> 37:13.522
Enjoy your meal.

37:19.278 --> 37:22.490
Tell me, how's your tooth? Is it all
better now?

37:22.573 --> 37:25.243
Yeah, it was just a wisdom tooth,
it's no big deal.

37:27.495 --> 37:31.123
Still, you bled a lot because of it.
You should at least take some herbal

37:31.207 --> 37:33.167
medicine. It will be good for you.

37:33.251 --> 37:36.587
Nah, that's not necessary. I don't
like that kind of medicine. So,

37:36.671 --> 37:38.047
forget it.

37:40.383 --> 37:43.552
I wanted to have a nice meal with you.
Why are we in the middle of the street?

37:43.636 --> 37:45.096
I like the hustle and bustle.

37:46.555 --> 37:50.184
But what if someone recognizes us?
You don't seem to realize that you're a

37:50.268 --> 37:53.729
celebrity now. You have to be careful.
And you shouldn't stay out so late

37:53.813 --> 37:55.189
at night. It's dangerous.

37:56.232 --> 37:58.442
Are you telling me what to do? I'm no
child.

38:00.152 --> 38:03.447
Of course I'm gonna do that. We're
seeing each other. Shouldn't that give

38:03.531 --> 38:04.699
me at least some right?

38:05.491 --> 38:09.412
It's not like it's a big deal. You expect
a lot when it's only a trial period.

38:19.797 --> 38:23.676
Okay, I'll take care of my grandfather,
so you don't have to think about him.

38:23.759 --> 38:25.970
And then… Tae-hee…

38:29.890 --> 38:34.562
that contract thing with her. I'll
settle that quickly… so don't worry.

38:35.146 --> 38:38.774
You're ending it already? Why? You need
to profit from it. It's already in

38:38.858 --> 38:41.360
place, so you might as well make the
most of it.

38:42.111 --> 38:45.573
The newspapers are saying that it's
a good move for both of you. You should

38:45.656 --> 38:49.493
go all out while you're still in this.
You don't have to walk on eggshells

38:49.577 --> 38:50.411
around me.

38:50.494 --> 38:53.331
Tell me, when have I ever walked
on eggshells around you? I've never

38:53.414 --> 38:54.957
been that way with anyone.

38:55.041 --> 38:58.044
You act so proud, but I've seen you
around your grandfather.

38:58.836 --> 38:59.670
No, that's just…

39:03.716 --> 39:05.634
because I really want him to like you.

39:06.886 --> 39:07.720
What?

39:08.220 --> 39:11.640
I want my grandfather… to have a
good impression of you.

39:17.938 --> 39:20.858
Well, it looks like your grandfather
prefers the schemer. I don't blame him.

39:20.941 --> 39:24.695
She has a powerful family behind her.

39:24.779 --> 39:27.531
Schemer? You've given her a nickname
already? She is a bit of a schemer,

39:27.615 --> 39:29.950
I'll give you that.

39:31.911 --> 39:35.748
Don't worry about it. As for family
backing? I don't care about that at all.

39:35.831 --> 39:40.795
I'm a very capable person. Look at
me right now. I'm doing just fine.

39:41.796 --> 39:45.549
Do you know what tall poppy syndrome is?
If you stand out too much, you're the

39:45.633 --> 39:49.261
first they'll cut down. If you're
above everyone, you'll end up withering

39:49.345 --> 39:53.516
away, alone at the top. I've seen
it happen too many times.

40:15.287 --> 40:16.122
You know…

40:18.332 --> 40:19.667
be careful of Choi Mun-do.

40:22.878 --> 40:24.046
And don't trust anyone.

40:26.966 --> 40:29.844
I know how to take care of myself.
Like I said, you don't need to

40:29.927 --> 40:30.761
worry about me.

40:31.804 --> 40:32.638
I wonder…

40:34.557 --> 40:37.226
is the world easy for you? You never
know when someone will attack you

40:37.309 --> 40:40.312
with a knife. Do you think it's the right
time to be fooling around with me, or

40:40.396 --> 40:41.730
whatever this is?

40:41.814 --> 40:44.608
Yes, the world is easy for me. It's
already crazy enough as it is, why

40:44.692 --> 40:46.444
complicate things further?

40:47.361 --> 40:50.114
It doesn't matter how I approach
things, if there's no hesitation,

40:50.197 --> 40:51.115
I have no regrets.

40:54.160 --> 40:57.746
What's difficult, is understanding you.
Strangely, the more I know you,

40:57.830 --> 41:00.166
the harder it gets.

41:03.627 --> 41:05.254
Is it because I'm so into you?

41:12.344 --> 41:14.638
Stop saying that. It's embarrassing.

41:14.722 --> 41:16.432
No one cares if it's embarrassing.

41:16.974 --> 41:18.684
Stop appearing in my dreams, then.

41:23.272 --> 41:24.106
But, what if…

41:26.317 --> 41:27.610
they're not really dreams?

41:27.693 --> 41:28.736
What?

41:28.819 --> 41:31.864
What if these aren't dreams? What would
you say to that?

41:32.448 --> 41:33.532
What do you mean?

41:35.743 --> 41:39.580
The court lady with no family or friends.
The hopelessly naive girl who gets

41:39.663 --> 41:44.793
constantly hazed by her peers. Kang
Dan-sim. What if I were really her?

41:47.338 --> 41:50.966
What would you do then? If I were
the woman who threw everything away to

41:51.050 --> 41:52.051
survive?

41:53.969 --> 41:54.803
You…

42:05.064 --> 42:05.981
COURT LADY KANG DAN-SIM

42:06.065 --> 42:08.817
THERE ARE NO SEARCH RESULTS
FOR COURT LADY KANG DAN-SIM

42:16.492 --> 42:17.743
What the hell am I doing?

42:36.178 --> 42:37.972
MS. SHIN, LET'S MEET SOON

42:38.847 --> 42:42.309
This Grand Prince… he has strong
feelings for a court lady named Kang

42:42.393 --> 42:44.353
Dan-sim. He truly loves…

42:46.522 --> 42:47.439
he truly yearns…

42:50.651 --> 42:55.364
he yearns for her. You can tell he's
in love with her… like the fool he is.

42:57.032 --> 43:01.287
There is no way of knowing for
sure… if he truly yearned for me.

43:05.958 --> 43:09.795
And even if he did, what does it matter
now?

43:14.383 --> 43:15.676
SEOUL MUSEUM OF HISTORY

43:15.759 --> 43:19.388
500 YEARS OF THE JOSEON DYNASTY
TIME TRAVEL HISTORY EXHIBITION 1392-2026

43:30.941 --> 43:34.570
Why do you stare with such interest?
Do you find it strange to see… plum

43:34.653 --> 43:36.947
blossoms in the summer?

43:46.624 --> 43:52.212
I remember, when I was painting this,
I had already buried him in my heart.

44:07.186 --> 44:10.898
You're the lady who was here before! Hi,
Huibin Kang! I'm glad to see you. I'm

44:10.981 --> 44:14.652
currently writing a thesis on a
reinterpretation of the evilist woman

44:14.735 --> 44:18.947
in history, Huibin Kang, so I was glad to
hear it.

44:21.283 --> 44:24.286
I see you're still digging into the story
of Huibin Kang.

44:30.000 --> 44:33.754
Kang Dan-sim. What if I were really
her? What would you do then?

44:39.343 --> 44:43.013
Mr. Cha, I thought you were leaving.
What are you thinking about in here?

44:46.183 --> 44:48.185
Do you believe we live past lives?

44:48.686 --> 44:51.271
What a random question. Yes, I do.
My family has been Buddhist for

44:51.355 --> 44:52.856
generations.

44:54.233 --> 44:57.653
So you think past lives, reincarnation,
all that's possible for you?

44:57.736 --> 45:00.864
There's no reason why not. We're living
our current life, so the one before this

45:00.948 --> 45:04.535
is our past life, and the one after is
our next life. Why do you ask?

45:06.036 --> 45:06.870
I was wondering…

45:08.997 --> 45:12.668
hypothetically, let's say… that someone
is here from the past. What would

45:12.751 --> 45:14.002
that mean?

45:14.628 --> 45:15.504
When in the past?

45:18.382 --> 45:19.675
The Joseon era…

45:19.758 --> 45:20.718
The Joseon era?

45:21.552 --> 45:24.596
Wait, has someone told you they're from
the Joseon era? Did they say you've

45:24.680 --> 45:27.474
made your ancestors angry and they
want money? This is a classic scam

45:27.558 --> 45:28.684
tactic used by cultists.

45:28.767 --> 45:29.977
That's not at all what I meant.

45:30.060 --> 45:33.188
Say you don't care if they're mad and you
don't need a rites ceremony, and if they

45:33.272 --> 45:36.859
say they'll harm you, then they're not
ancestors, but demons. Let's go.

45:39.486 --> 45:41.572
Wow, I never should've asked him.

45:44.241 --> 45:45.909
I just made it super awkward now.

45:49.872 --> 45:52.541
You're an actress, right? In "Kingdom
of Women Two?"

45:54.626 --> 45:57.880
I knew you had a certain presence
about you. Ever since I started

45:57.963 --> 46:01.425
interning here, I've come across some
really interesting pieces like,

46:01.508 --> 46:04.970
well… there's a piece that isn't fully
preserved, and therefore isn't

46:05.053 --> 46:08.724
very popular with our visitors, but
all of us here call it, 'The Portrait

46:08.807 --> 46:12.519
of a Beauty." Let me show you.

46:32.080 --> 46:35.459
It really looks like you. You can only
partially see her face, but the

46:35.542 --> 46:39.129
resemblance to you is truly uncanny.
I guess it's true, doppelgangers

46:39.213 --> 46:41.215
really do exist.

46:49.306 --> 46:53.268
But what's even more amazing about this
portrait is that it's some sort of love

46:53.352 --> 46:57.815
letter. Did you notice the poem on
the right of her? "By heaven."

46:58.398 --> 47:02.152
And it's not just any kind of paper,
this is extremely valuable pure hanji.

47:02.236 --> 47:05.989
For someone to paint this portrait
on such precious paper, and write a love

47:06.073 --> 47:09.993
letter, it must've been an extraordinary
love. Or the end of a love that could

47:10.077 --> 47:11.245
not be expressed.

47:12.162 --> 47:13.163
Isn't that romantic?

47:15.123 --> 47:17.209
My gift to you, my companion.

47:33.892 --> 47:36.687
-Oh, the Grand Prince is coming.
-Clear the way! Away with you! Make way!

47:36.770 --> 47:37.980
Why is the Grand Prince here? Quick, move
to the side.

47:38.063 --> 47:40.774
What are they doing? He's the
Crown Prince's full brother.

47:40.858 --> 47:44.152
Oh, my goodness, he's so handsome!
But what has he done?

47:44.653 --> 47:47.322
-He wears a mask.
-I hear he's a real philanderer.

47:47.406 --> 47:49.950
He seems to take great care of his
appearance.

48:34.828 --> 48:38.290
What would you achieve by following him?
Would you run away together?

48:41.543 --> 48:45.130
As I thought. You shall remain silent.
Bury it in your heart so you may

48:45.213 --> 48:46.423
survive here.

48:48.926 --> 48:49.801
Take this.

48:52.554 --> 48:55.474
I am the one giving this to you,
not the Grand Prince. You can

48:55.557 --> 48:58.101
survive here without needing help from
anybody.

49:38.976 --> 49:39.977
I don't know…

49:42.145 --> 49:43.647
How can anyone call that love?

49:46.358 --> 49:49.194
To love in silence and never express it
to your beloved…

49:52.614 --> 49:54.825
just makes your heart rot and turn to
stone.

49:58.161 --> 50:00.288
How can that be considered love by
anyone?

50:06.712 --> 50:11.591
SEOUL MUSEUM OF HISTORY
HISTORY EXHIBITION 1392-2026

50:14.386 --> 50:15.637
Love… what a joke.

50:23.979 --> 50:26.481
You never even once showed a sliver of
your heart.

50:29.651 --> 50:33.822
Yet, you foolishly play with stones, and
clench your fists in silence.

50:53.091 --> 50:55.886
Tell me, do you truly yearn for my
affection?

50:56.762 --> 51:00.265
I do yearn for you. Screw the world and
everybody else. Let's let our hearts

51:00.348 --> 51:01.683
flutter.

51:04.478 --> 51:05.729
I wanna be your only one.

51:08.940 --> 51:15.322
I will cease this. I refuse to continue
living… so foolishly.

51:28.210 --> 51:29.795
GEONGUK HERBAL MEDICINE

51:31.088 --> 51:34.716
Owner! I need you to give me medicinal
herbs. I need the rarest and most

51:34.800 --> 51:37.177
expensive ones! Hurry up, please,
I need to go!

51:41.223 --> 51:43.558
So, now, have you found a position for
Se-gye?

51:44.059 --> 51:47.104
I have. Creating a position is
not the issue, I'm worried

51:47.187 --> 51:50.524
about internal opposition. I'm sure
Se-gye would prefer to return to a

51:50.607 --> 51:54.194
firm that welcomes him back. It would be
good optics.

51:55.112 --> 51:57.114
Exactly what kind of plan do you have in
mind?

51:57.197 --> 51:59.533
I have a position that needs the
right person.

52:00.742 --> 52:04.412
I was thinking that you could put him in
charge of the US office. If he proves

52:04.496 --> 52:07.749
his abilities and becomes an asset to
the firm, this will surely stop

52:07.833 --> 52:08.667
any opposition.

52:10.001 --> 52:10.836
I see.

52:12.796 --> 52:14.422
Okay, I'll give it some thought.

52:18.760 --> 52:20.554
-There's nothing in here. Look, there is
-What?

52:20.637 --> 52:23.640
Only water. I don't see a single herb
inside this little bag.

52:23.723 --> 52:26.935
It's not water, it's a herbal decoction.
If you want raw herbs in individual

52:27.018 --> 52:30.272
portions like the old days, we don't sell
them like that anymore. It would be

52:30.355 --> 52:32.732
a lot of trouble for you to decoct
them yourself.

52:32.816 --> 52:36.361
Do you mean to say you have already
sorted the herbs into these bags? Wow! I

52:36.444 --> 52:40.115
was wondering how my knees would
survive all that crouching to infuse

52:40.198 --> 52:44.619
the herbs, portion by portion. The
world really has become more simple.

52:50.542 --> 52:51.418
Thank you, sir!

52:58.425 --> 53:01.803
Cha Se-gye, come straight over
after work. I have something to say.

53:05.265 --> 53:08.518
Why be stingy with your heart?
If you save it, it turns to stone.

53:11.271 --> 53:14.858
Yes. My plans have changed, so I won't
be able to make it this weekend.

53:14.941 --> 53:18.612
Don't tell Seo-jun, I don't want
to let him down. Let me see how it goes,

53:18.695 --> 53:20.780
and I'll let you know.

53:47.265 --> 53:48.099
SECRETARY SEO

53:54.731 --> 53:57.567
Mr. Choi, there's a new announcement
on the intranet…

54:05.283 --> 54:06.117
I can't believe this!

54:06.201 --> 54:07.452
Did you know about this?

54:07.535 --> 54:08.870
There was a rumor, but no one knew.

54:08.954 --> 54:09.788
This changes a lot of things.

54:09.871 --> 54:11.706
I didn't know they were even talking
about this.

54:11.790 --> 54:13.208
Mr. Choi needs to read this.

54:14.334 --> 54:16.962
CHAIL PERSONNEL APPOINTMENT ANNOUNCEMENT
EFFECTIVE DATE: 01. 01. 2027

54:17.045 --> 54:20.298
APPOINTMENT: (TRANSFER) BRANCH MANAGER, US
APPOINTEE: CHOI MUN-DO

54:26.513 --> 54:29.015
IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE RESOLUTION
OF THE CHAIL BOARD OF DIRECTORS

54:29.099 --> 54:30.183
WE HEREBY NOTIFY YOU
OF THE ABOVE CHANGE IN POSITION

54:30.267 --> 54:32.435
OCTOBER 19, 2026
CHAIL CHAIRMAN, CHA DAL-SU

54:39.943 --> 54:43.571
Mr. Cha, the nurse who was hospitalized
contacted us. She says she has something

54:43.655 --> 54:44.781
important to tell you.

54:51.288 --> 54:53.665
I might be late, but I'll definitely
be there.

55:27.282 --> 55:29.159
What are you doing here at this hour?

55:38.460 --> 55:40.337
You're such an idiot, I'm out of here.

55:40.420 --> 55:43.882
CONGRATULATIONS ON THE OPENING
OF YOUR CLINIC, CHAIL E&amp;C CHOI MUN-DO

55:54.017 --> 55:57.562
Now I realize just how desperately
you want the chairman position since you

55:57.645 --> 55:59.522
have no issues stalking me like this.

56:03.026 --> 56:06.905
Still… you shouldn't have used illegal
methods.

56:06.988 --> 56:10.742
I'm so sorry, I shouldn't have done
what they asked me no matter how much

56:10.825 --> 56:14.829
money they offered. I promise to pay for
what I've done, but please, you have to

56:14.913 --> 56:15.747
help me.

56:21.086 --> 56:25.465
So what? You think you've got me by the
throat now?

56:28.218 --> 56:31.596
I know you sacrificed everything
for this, and I know how desperate

56:31.679 --> 56:34.015
you are, but… didn't you think of
Seo-jun?

57:03.628 --> 57:07.340
You're right. I had to put everything
on the line to get in this position.

57:07.424 --> 57:11.636
And you? What have you sacrificed?

57:13.721 --> 57:17.183
You screw up everything you touch,
and bully others with your status.

57:17.267 --> 57:20.270
Do you think you deserve this?

57:27.610 --> 57:30.655
Forget it. I'm done here.

57:52.177 --> 57:54.929
-What are you doing?
-I have something to show you too.

58:16.117 --> 58:17.118
What is this?

58:17.952 --> 58:21.456
Why don't you ask her yourself? What sort
of things are there for a man

58:21.539 --> 58:23.791
and a woman to do when they're alone
together?

58:23.875 --> 58:26.503
Don't be ridiculous. What kind
of business could someone like you

58:26.586 --> 58:30.715
have with her? You probably thought you
could blackmail me with these photos.

58:30.798 --> 58:34.594
You seem to really trust her. Do you
know what kind of deal she and I made?

58:40.225 --> 58:43.811
You seem to have made a miscalculation.
That's too bad. You think I'd get

58:43.895 --> 58:46.814
involved with her? Really?

58:49.943 --> 58:53.238
You think Uncle's gonna believe that?
He's not an idiot. He's still

58:53.321 --> 58:56.991
heartbroken that his only son, who was
on top of the world, flushed his

58:57.075 --> 59:00.995
life down the drain by getting involved
with the wrong woman. Can you imagine…

59:01.079 --> 59:04.791
what he'd say about this girl?

59:09.254 --> 59:12.840
I mean, you know better than anyone after
how Uncle treated your mother.

59:12.924 --> 59:14.384
You little bastard, I should…

59:16.427 --> 59:19.847
That's right. Never give someone
something they can use against you.

59:19.931 --> 59:23.518
The more things you care about,
the weaker you become.

59:24.561 --> 59:27.480
You drop out of the firm and I'll
forget about everything.

59:28.022 --> 59:31.109
And of course, I'll make sure Uncle knows
nothing about this.

01:00:01.556 --> 01:00:04.309
What a surprise. He said he'd be late.

01:00:07.353 --> 01:00:10.481
Cha Se-gye. You're already here.

01:00:19.115 --> 01:00:20.867
What were you doing out so late?

01:00:22.076 --> 01:00:23.328
I had something to do.

01:00:23.411 --> 01:00:25.330
GIFTING HEALTH
THROUGH CARE AFFECTION

01:00:26.080 --> 01:00:29.334
I've had a headache all day from the
bomb you dropped on me, but you don't

01:00:29.417 --> 01:00:31.878
seem to have a care in the world. How
depressing.

01:00:34.797 --> 01:00:36.549
No, Cha Se-gye, that's not at all…

01:00:36.633 --> 01:00:38.509
You just throw things out carelessly…

01:00:39.427 --> 01:00:42.180
and treat me like a doormat, but
here I am, once again.

01:00:44.349 --> 01:00:45.600
Crawling towards you.

01:00:45.683 --> 01:00:47.894
I never did that. That is not why--

01:00:47.977 --> 01:00:50.063
Is it because you don't have faith in me?

01:00:53.900 --> 01:00:57.278
I hoped you wouldn't keep secrets
from me, but I hear you met with Choi

01:00:57.362 --> 01:00:59.822
Mun-do. Why didn't you tell me?

01:01:00.323 --> 01:01:01.199
Oh, I was going to--

01:01:01.282 --> 01:01:04.243
He tells me he made a deal with you.
You should've told me.

01:01:04.869 --> 01:01:07.205
Whatever it was, I could've done more
for you.

01:01:08.706 --> 01:01:11.709
I thought I had proven myself and finally
earned your trust…

01:01:14.545 --> 01:01:18.049
but I guess I was wrong. What more
do I have to do? What proof do you need

01:01:18.132 --> 01:01:23.054
now to believe in me, and open
your heart.

01:01:26.307 --> 01:01:29.519
If you truly don't feel the same way
about me, then just use me.

01:01:30.186 --> 01:01:32.271
For you, I'll happily let myself be used.

01:01:46.452 --> 01:01:50.123
Okay… Now, you're acting like
yourself again.

01:01:52.667 --> 01:01:56.129
You said you'd be able to throw
everything away. If that's true, then

01:01:56.212 --> 01:01:59.799
stop trying to be nice to me, or
pretending to worry about me. You need

01:01:59.882 --> 01:02:05.513
to think about yourself. If you wanna be
cold with me, then do it right!

01:02:10.810 --> 01:02:12.729
Stop playing around with my feelings.

01:02:17.275 --> 01:02:24.115
Let go of me. Let go! Let go! Stop!
Let go! Let go! No!

01:02:58.232 --> 01:03:02.570
Because of you, I'm losing my mind.

01:03:13.206 --> 01:03:14.123
Whoever you are…

01:03:17.835 --> 01:03:19.003
wherever you came from…

01:03:22.048 --> 01:03:22.882
I believe you.

01:03:24.091 --> 01:03:24.926
What?

01:03:26.427 --> 01:03:28.513
Whatever you're gonna say, I believe you.

01:03:30.807 --> 01:03:31.891
You have to trust me.

01:03:36.562 --> 01:03:39.398
Forget all the assholes out there,
and just focus on me!

01:03:43.444 --> 01:03:44.278
Please.

01:04:33.828 --> 01:04:37.415
MY ROYAL NEMESIS

01:05:04.901 --> 01:05:06.235
We're done with our trial period?

01:05:06.319 --> 01:05:07.486
Let's go on a date, Cha Se-gye.

01:05:07.570 --> 01:05:08.404
Why now?

01:05:08.487 --> 01:05:10.656
I'm going to give myself freely from
now on.

01:05:10.740 --> 01:05:13.242
So, you're my sweet Seo-ri's new
boyfriend?

01:05:13.326 --> 01:05:14.160
Please forgive me.

01:05:14.243 --> 01:05:16.829
It looks like we're on the brink
of a regime change.

01:05:16.913 --> 01:05:18.915
Mr. Cha has just entered HQ.

01:05:18.998 --> 01:05:20.917
Do you think I'll back down without a
fight?

01:05:21.000 --> 01:05:22.418
Have you seen the patient in Room 12?

01:05:22.501 --> 01:05:24.211
Are you sure… you can handle this?

01:05:24.962 --> 01:05:27.214
You lured and threatened a helpless old
lady?

01:05:28.049 --> 01:05:30.051
Ms. Shin, you have nothing to lose.

01:05:30.134 --> 01:05:32.803
I hate you being involved with Choi
Mun-do in any way!

01:05:32.887 --> 01:05:35.139
Well, you're worse than him. You hurt me
more!

01:05:35.222 --> 01:05:37.975
What I want is for Se-gye's wife to
have a lot to give.

01:05:38.726 --> 01:05:40.811
Shin Seo-ri. Answer your damn phone!
